      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "A **path** in a topological space $X$ is a continuous map $f\\colon I\\to X$, where $I=[0,1]$ is the unit interval. Its start point is $f(0)=x_0$ and its end point is $f(1)=x_1$; a path with $x_0=x_1$ is a **loop** based at $x_0$.",
          "zh-CN": "拓扑空间 $X$ 中的**道路**是连续映射 $f\\colon I\\to X$，其中 $I=[0,1]$ 为单位区间。其起点为 $f(0)=x_0$，终点为 $f(1)=x_1$；起点与终点相同的道路称为以 $x_0$ 为**基点**的闭路。"
        }
      }
